Z||000000||Cozmo||09-23-2001||10:48 AM||||<B>OK...OK...</B><BR>I totally agree the MR2 wing on the Targa is supreme butt ugly <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>But until I talk our club's V.P. into selling me his DGP wing I will continue to do "experiments" with some other types.<BR>How about this one?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newwinga.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newwing.jpg"> <BR>This thing is huge but rearward visibility is much better than the MR2 or the factory wing.<BR>Whaddya all think???<BR>Be gentle, this IS just "experimenting" <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BobC||||reg||10
